## ✅ COMPLETED FEATURES (READY FOR LAUNCH)

### **Core Platform Features:**
1. ✅ **User Authentication & Profiles**
   - Email/password registration and login
   - Google OAuth integration
   - Profile management (avatar, username, bio)
   - Date of Birth verification for age-restricted content

2. ✅ **Room System (1:Many Relationship)**
   - Users can create unlimited rooms
   - Public/private room visibility
   - Room customization (name, description, image, host visibility)
   - Persistent room chat (WebSocket-based)
   - Members system with join/leave functionality
   - Room image upload (circular avatar style)

3. ✅ **Watch Session Types (4 Modes)**
   - **Upload Tab**: Host uploads video files (MP4, WebM) for synchronized viewing
   - **WatchFrom Tab**: Host streams from external URLs (YouTube, Vimeo, direct links)
   - **LiveShare Tab**: Real-time webcam/screen streaming via LiveKit
   - **Watching Now**: Public session discovery feed with fullscreen swipe navigation

4. ✅ **LiveShare System (Professional Streaming)**
   - **4 Share Types**: Camera, Screen Share, Screen+Camera, Podcast/Interview
   - **4 LiveShare Modes**: Podcast, News, Show, Church (with themed graphics)
   - **Layout Options**: Solo-view, Split-view (side-by-side), Panel-view, Screen-share
   - **Camera Selection**: Dropdown to choose professional cameras (DSLR, studio cams, capture cards)
   - **Guest System**: Invite specific guest for interview/podcast mode
   - **Auto-Mute with Exemption**: Mute all members except selected guest on session start
   - **Adaptive Bitrate**: 2-5 Mbps based on network quality
   - **Layout Sync**: All members see host's selected layout in real-time

5. ✅ **Session Controls & Moderation**
   - **Playback Controls**: Play, pause, seek, volume (Upload/WatchFrom modes)
   - **Host Controls**: End session, mute all, unmute individual, kick members
   - **Raise Hand System**: Members request to unmute, automatically clears when unmuted
   - **Emote System**: 6 emotes (👍❤️😂🎉🔥👏) with floating animations, sounds, and member card display
   - **Individual Mute/Unmute**: Host can mute/unmute specific members during session

6. ✅ **Ticketing & Monetization**
   - **Free Sessions**: Open to all room members
   - **Paid Sessions**: Token-based ticketing (10-500 tokens per ticket)
   - **Early Bird Pricing**: Discounted tickets with countdown timer
   - **Ticket Gifting**: Transfer tickets to other users (5% platform fee)
   - **Age-Restricted Content**: G, PG, PG-13, R, NC-17 ratings with DOB verification
   - **Revenue Split**: 75% host earnings, 25% platform commission
   - **Platform Accounting**: Real-time GMV, revenue, reserve balance tracking

7. ✅ **Token Economy**
   - **Token Purchase**: Paystack integration (₦10 = 100 tokens, ₦165 = 1650 tokens)
   - **Token Wallet**: Real-time balance tracking
   - **Token Spending**: Tickets, donations, session tips
   - **Token Gifting**: Wallet-to-wallet transfers (5% commission)
   - **Exchange Rate**: 1 token = ₦0.10 (100 tokens = ₦10)

8. ✅ **Scheduled Events**
   - Create future watch sessions with date/time
   - Email notifications 1 hour before event start
   - Browser push notifications (if enabled)
   - Upcoming events section on room page
   - RSVP system for free events

9. ✅ **Chat System**
   - Persistent room chat (survives page refresh)
   - Voice notes with waveform animation
   - Message editing and deletion
   - Emoji picker integration
   - Unread message counter
   - Auto-scroll to bottom with manual scroll lock

10. ✅ **Admin Dashboard (Super Admin Only)**
    - **Platform Analytics**: Users, rooms, sessions (today/week/month/quarter/year)
    - **Revenue Metrics**: GMV, platform revenue, host reserve balance
    - **Token Analytics**: Purchased, spent, minted, burned
    - **Top Performers**: Highest earning hosts, most active rooms
    - **Payout Management**: Approve/reject/complete withdrawal requests
    - **Event Analytics**: Ticket sales, early bird usage, revenue by watch type
    - **Manual Commission Transfer**: Token donation commission (5%) from reserve to revenue account

11. ✅ **Withdrawal System**
    - **Auto-Approval**: 95% of withdrawals auto-approved (unflagged accounts)
    - **Bank Transfer**: Paystack integration for Nigerian bank accounts
    - **Processing States**: Pending → Processing → Completed
    - **Manual Completion**: Admin marks completed if Paystack starter account fails auto-transfer
    - **Minimum Withdrawal**: ₦100 (1,000 tokens)

12. ✅ **Responsive Design**
    - Mobile-first UI (works on phones, tablets, desktops)
    - Fullscreen video player with swipe navigation (mobile)
    - Adaptive layouts for all screen sizes
    - Touch-optimized controls

