## 🧪 AUTOMATED TESTING & QA STRATEGY

### **Current Testing State (April 22, 2026):**

**✅ E2E Testing Framework Implemented:**
- **Tool**: Playwright (modern alternative to Cypress)
- **Coverage**: 13 critical path tests implemented
- **Browsers**: Chromium, Firefox, WebKit, Mobile Chrome, Mobile Safari
- **CI/CD**: GitHub Actions workflow ready (`.github/workflows/e2e-tests.yml`)

**Test Structure:**
```
frontend/tests/
├── fixtures/
│   ├── auth.fixture.js          # Authenticated page fixture
│   └── test-data.js             # Test data constants (users, sessions, payments)
├── page-objects/
│   ├── LoginPage.js             # Login page interactions
│   ├── LobbyPage.js             # Lobby/dashboard
│   └── SessionCreationModal.js  # Session creation modal
└── e2e/
    ├── auth/
    │   └── login.spec.js        # TC-AUTH-001 to TC-AUTH-007
    ├── session/
    │   └── create-session.spec.js  # TC-SESSION-001 to TC-SESSION-007
    ├── realtime/
    │   └── websocket.spec.js    # TC-REALTIME-001, TC-REALTIME-004, TC-REALTIME-006
    └── liveshare/
        └── graphics.spec.js     # TC-LIVESHARE-001 to TC-LIVESHARE-005
```

**Implemented Test Cases:**

| Test ID | Feature | Status |
|---------|---------|--------|
| TC-AUTH-001 | Login with valid credentials | ✅ |
| TC-AUTH-003 | Login with invalid password | ✅ |
| TC-AUTH-004 | Logout functionality | ✅ |
| TC-AUTH-007 | Redirect to login (protected routes) | ✅ |
| TC-SESSION-001 | Create free instant watch | ✅ |
| TC-SESSION-002 | Create paid session | ✅ |
| TC-SESSION-004 | Create lecture hall | ✅ |
| TC-SESSION-006 | End session | ✅ |
| TC-SESSION-007 | Search sessions | ✅ |
| TC-REALTIME-001 | WebSocket connection | ✅ |
| TC-REALTIME-004 | Chat message broadcast | ✅ |
| TC-REALTIME-006 | Reconnection after disconnect | ✅ |
| TC-LIVESHARE-001 | Start LiveShare camera mode | ✅ |
| TC-LIVESHARE-002 | Enable lower third graphic | ✅ |
| TC-LIVESHARE-003 | Enable ticker | ✅ |
| TC-LIVESHARE-004 | Start break mode | ✅ |
| TC-LIVESHARE-005 | End LiveShare | ✅ |

**Running Tests:**
```bash
cd ~/WeWatch/frontend

# Install dependencies (one-time)
npm install -D @playwright/test
npx playwright install

# Run all tests
npm run test

# Run with UI (interactive mode)
npm run test:ui

# Run specific test file
npx playwright test tests/e2e/auth/login.spec.js

# Generate HTML report
npm run test:report
```

**CI/CD Integration:**
- GitHub Actions workflow: `.github/workflows/e2e-tests.yml`
- Runs on every push to `main` or `dev` branches
- Runs on every pull request
- Starts PostgreSQL, backend, frontend automatically
- Uploads test reports and screenshots on failure

