## Session Rating & Review System (April 17, 2026) ✅

### Overview
Post-session rating system allowing users to rate and review watch sessions to build host reputation and help other users discover quality content.

### Architecture

#### SessionRatingModal Component
- **Path**: `frontend/src/components/SessionRatingModal.jsx` (167 lines)
- **Purpose**: Modal for rating sessions after they end
- **Trigger**: Appears after paid cinema/video sessions end (feature in progress)
- **Status**: ✅ Component complete and responsive

#### Props Interface
```jsx
<SessionRatingModal
  isOpen={boolean}                    // Controls modal visibility
  onClose={() => void}                // Handler for closing modal
  sessionId={number}                  // Session being rated
  hostName={string}                   // Display name of session host
  sessionTitle={string}               // Title of session (line-clamped)
  onSubmit={({ rating, review }) => Promise<void>}  // Submit handler
/>
```

#### Features

**1. Star Rating System (1-5 stars)**
- **Lines 81-114**: 5 interactive star buttons
- **Interaction**: Click to set rating, hover to preview
- **Visual States**:
  - Filled: Yellow stars with `fill-current` (selected)
  - Empty: Gray outline stars (unselected)
  - Hover: Scale effect (`hover:scale-110`) with preview state
- **Feedback Text**:
  - 0 stars: "Click a star to rate"
  - 1 star: "😞 Poor"
  - 2 stars: "😐 Below Average"
  - 3 stars: "🙂 Average"
  - 4 stars: "😊 Good"
  - 5 stars: "🤩 Excellent!"

**2. Optional Written Review**
- **Lines 121-134**: Textarea with character limit
- **Max Length**: 500 characters
- **Placeholder**: "Share your thoughts about this session..."
- **Character Counter**: Real-time count display (e.g., "127/500 characters")
- **Validation**: Trimmed before submission (whitespace removed)

**3. Responsive Design (Updated April 17, 2026)**
All screen sizes supported with mobile-first approach:

**Mobile (< 640px):**
- Outer padding: `p-3`
- Header padding: `p-4`
- Title: `text-lg` (smaller)
- Close button icon: `w-5 h-5`
- Star icons: `w-10 h-10`
- Star gap: `gap-1` (tighter spacing)
- Content spacing: `space-y-4`
- Button text: `text-sm`
- Button padding: `px-3 py-2.5`
- Textarea padding: `px-3 py-2`

**Tablet & Desktop (≥ 640px):**
- Outer padding: `sm:p-4`
- Header padding: `sm:p-6`
- Title: `sm:text-2xl`
- Close button icon: `sm:w-6 sm:h-6`
- Star icons: `sm:w-12 sm:h-12`
- Star gap: `sm:gap-2`
- Content spacing: `sm:space-y-6`
- Button text: `sm:text-base`
- Button padding: `sm:px-4 sm:py-3`
- Textarea padding: `sm:px-4 sm:py-3`

**Responsive Features:**
- Header text: `line-clamp-2` on session title to prevent overflow
- Header layout: `flex justify-between items-start gap-3` for proper spacing
- Close button: `flex-shrink-0` prevents squishing
- Header text container: `flex-1 min-w-0` enables text truncation
- Smooth transitions on all interactive elements
- Touch-friendly tap targets on mobile (larger padding)

**4. Validation & Submission**
- **Lines 19-39**: Submit handler
- **Validation**: Must select at least 1 star (review is optional)
- **Error Handling**: Toast notifications for errors
- **Success Flow**: 
  1. Shows success toast: "Thanks for your feedback! 🌟"
  2. Calls `onSubmit({ rating, review: trimmedReview })`
  3. Closes modal automatically
- **Loading State**: Button shows "Submitting..." during async operation
- **Disabled State**: Submit button disabled when no rating selected

**5. Design & UX**
- **Header**: Purple-to-blue gradient with session context
- **Layout**: Centered modal with backdrop blur
- **Animation**: Fade-in effect (`animate-fade-in`)
- **Close Options**: 
  - X button (top-right)
  - Skip button (bottom-left) - No rating submitted
- **Accessibility**: 
  - ARIA labels on buttons
  - Keyboard navigation support
  - Focus management

#### Integration Points (Future)

**1. Watch Session Components**
Need to integrate in these files when session ends:
- `frontend/src/components/cinema/VideoWatch.jsx`
- `frontend/src/components/cinema/3d-cinema/CinemaScene3DDemo.jsx`
- `frontend/src/pages/LectureHallPage.jsx`

**2. Backend API (Not Yet Implemented)**
Expected endpoint:
```javascript
POST /api/sessions/:id/ratings
Body: {
  rating: number (1-5),
  review: string (optional, max 500 chars)
}
Response: {
  success: boolean,
  message: string,
  rating_id: number
}
```

**3. Database Schema (Not Yet Implemented)**
Expected table: `session_ratings`
```sql
CREATE TABLE session_ratings (
  id SERIAL PRIMARY KEY,
  session_id INTEGER REFERENCES watch_sessions(session_id),
  user_id INTEGER REFERENCES users(id),
  rating INTEGER CHECK (rating >= 1 AND rating <= 5),
  review TEXT,
  created_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  updated_at TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
  UNIQUE(session_id, user_id)  -- One rating per user per session
);
```

**4. Host Reputation Display (Future Enhancement)**
Commented section in component (lines 150-154):
```jsx
{/* 📊 FUTURE: Show host's current rating here */}
{/* <div className="text-center pt-4 border-t border-gray-200">
  <p className="text-xs text-gray-500">
    {hostName}'s average rating: ⭐ 4.8 / 5.0 (127 reviews)
  </p>
</div> */}
```

#### Typical Usage Flow

```jsx
import SessionRatingModal from './components/SessionRatingModal';

const VideoWatch = () => {
  const [showRatingModal, setShowRatingModal] = useState(false);
  const [sessionInfo, setSessionInfo] = useState(null);

  const handleSessionEnd = () => {
    // Show rating modal after paid session ends
    if (sessionStatus.pricing_tier === 'paid') {
      setSessionInfo({
        id: sessionStatus.session_id,
        title: sessionStatus.session_title,
        hostName: sessionStatus.host_name
      });
      setShowRatingModal(true);
    }
  };

  const handleSubmitRating = async ({ rating, review }) => {
    await apiClient.post(`/api/sessions/${sessionInfo.id}/ratings`, {
      rating,
      review
    });
  };

  return (
    <>
      {/* Watch session UI */}
      
      <SessionRatingModal
        isOpen={showRatingModal}
        onClose={() => setShowRatingModal(false)}
        sessionId={sessionInfo?.id}
        hostName={sessionInfo?.hostName}
        sessionTitle={sessionInfo?.title}
        onSubmit={handleSubmitRating}
      />
    </>
  );
};
```

